(47, 14, 'webns-bus-man-2024-apr-21', 'Md. Naimul Islam`', 'naimislam178@gmail.com', '8801683377818', '150000', 'N/A', 'admin/pdf/career/18494CV of Md. Naimul Islam.pdf', 'webns-bus-man-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-22-md-naimul-islam-77818', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-22 14:03:15', '2024-04-22 14:19:41'),
(48, 13, 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21', 'Md.Jayed Al Joney', 'jayedjoney@gmail.com', '01780563471', '50000', 'Dear Concern,\r\nI am writing concerning a suitable position in Sr. Executive for Business Development with your organization. I have a particular interest in working for your organization and would appreciate being considered as a candidate for employment. I feel I can make a positive contribution to your company.\r\n\r\nI have completed BSS (Honours) at Gono Bishwabidyalay, and MBA Major in Finance, ASA University Bangladesh. I am including Microsoft Word, Excel, Access, and PowerPoint. I work effectively under pressure and handle my time efficiently. I have developed excellent communication skills through my supervisory experience and campus leadership roles.\r\n\r\nMy Curriculum Vitae and photo are attached. I appreciate your consideration of my credentials. If I can provide you with additional information, please let me know. You can reach me by email at jayedjoney@gmail.com or by phone at +8801780563471. I look forward to discussing my qualifications with you in person.\r\n\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nMd.Jayed Al Joney\r\n\r\n\r\nEnclosures:\r\nCurriculum Vitae and Photo', 'admin/pdf/career/16716MD JAYED AL JONEY .pdf', 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-22-mdjayed-al-joney-63471', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-22 14:13:15', '2024-04-22 14:19:45'),
(49, 13, 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21', 'Kazi Nasif Hasan', 'k.nasif.hasan@gmail.com', '8801758115424', '70000', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Executive/Sr. Executive for Business Development position at WEBNS Technology Ltd. As a seasoned professional with a proven track record in corporate B2B software sales & marketing, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nMy experience aligns well with the responsibilities outlined in the job description. In my previous role, I successfully secured new business opportunities, identified and executed new local market opportunities, and maintained client relationships. Notably, I increased revenue and profit by identifying new potential partners and acquisitions.\r\n\r\nWith a post-graduation and 3 years of experience in Corporate Sales & Marketing, I am equipped to excel in this role. My key competencies include proactive attitude, strong business communication, excellent presentation skills, and proficiency in Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and email.\r\n\r\nI am eager to bring my unique skill set to WEBNS Technology Ltd. and to contribute to the ongoing success of your team. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nKazi Nasif Hasan', 'admin/pdf/career/10631CV-Kazi_Nasif_Hasan.2024.pdf', 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-22-kazi-nasif-hasan-15424', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-22 15:55:52', '2024-04-22 15:55:52'),
(50, 13, 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21', 'Mazbahur Rahman', 'misbah.rahman55@gmail.com', '01685725059', '45000', 'MAZBAHUR RAHMAN  \r\nSenior Executive | MBA-HRM | AIUB\r\n\r\nContact: +880 1685725059	Email: misbah.rahman55@gmail.com 	LinkedIn: in/mazbahur-Rahman\r\n	\r\n22th April 2024 \r\nHiring Manager \r\nWebns Technology Limited\r\nLevel-07, 152/2A-2, Rowshan Tower, \r\nPanthapath, Dhaka-1205.\r\n\r\nDear Concern \r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Senior Executive position at Webns Technology Ltd, as advertised. With a Master of Business Administration in Human Resource Management from the American International University - Bangladesh and solid experience as an Senior Executive of Human Resources at AAA Finance Investment & Limited, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\r\nAt AAA Finance Investment & Limited, I spearheaded various HR initiatives, including talent acquisition, performance management, and policy development. One notable achievement was streamlining the on boarding process, which resulted in a 30% reduction in average on boarding time, ultimately enhancing employee satisfaction and productivity. Moreover, my leadership in managing a team of 10+ members led to a 15% increase in overall productivity. These experiences have equipped me with the skills necessary to excel in a dynamic HR environment.\r\nI am particularly drawn to Webns Technology Ltd because of its commitment to their priorities are motivating high performance, fostering the growth of the next generation of leaders, an exciting workplace environment where both individuals and teams can succeed. I am eager to leverage my expertise in HR strategy and organisational development to contribute to the achievement of these objectives. Additionally, I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to be part of such an innovative and forward-thinking team.\r\nEnclosed is my resume, which provides additional details about my qualifications and accomplishments. I am excited about the possibility of joining Webns Technology Ltd and contributing to its continued success. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team.', 'admin/pdf/career/17501MAZBAHUR RAHMAN RESUME.pdf', 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-22-mazbahur-rahman-25059', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-22 16:23:56', '2024-04-22 16:23:56'),
(51, 13, 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21', 'Muhammad Abu Naser Nahid', 'nahid.isl321@gmail.com', '01754542777', '45000', 'Dear Sir,\r\n\r\nHope you are doing well and this letter finds you in good health. \r\n\r\nAs per your requirement for the \"Sr. Executive, Corporate Sales\", I\'ve attached my Resume & matched the all requirements you mentioned on the job circular with me. \r\n\r\nI would very much like to discuss opportunities with you. To schedule an interview, please feel free to reach me at your convenient. \r\n\r\nThank you for taking the time to review my resume. I look forward to talking with you.', 'admin/pdf/career/16172CV of Nahid.pdf', 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-22-muhammad-abu-naser-nahid-42777', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-23 00:53:53', '2024-04-23 00:53:53'),
(52, 13, 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21', 'FARJANA AKTER TAMANNA', 'tamannafarjanadhk@gmail.com', '01682026585', '25000', 'Sir,\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Executive/Sr. Executive, Corporate Sales position in Business Development at WEBNS Technology Ltd., as advertised. With a solid background in business studies, more than 3 years of practical experience in Marketing and Business Development, and a passion for driving strategic growth initiatives, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your dynamic team.\r\n\r\nI am enthusiastic about the possibility of joining your team and contributing to the achievement of your business objectives. I have attached my resume for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience and expertise can benefit WEBNS Technology Ltd.\r\nPlease feel free to contact me at 01682026585 or via email at tamannafarjanadhk@gmail.com to schedule a meeting at your convenience.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nFarjana Tamanna.', 'admin/pdf/career/12204FARJANA TAMANNA-ME.pdf', 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-23-farjana-akter-tamanna-26585', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-23 08:31:36', '2024-04-23 08:31:36'),
(53, 14, 'webns-bus-man-2024-apr-21', 'Md. Rabiul Islam', 'irabiul@hotmail.com', '01676660624', '69k', 'Rabiul Islam\r\nirabiul@hotmail.com | +88 01676660624 | Address: 9, SA. /1, Karobi, Lake City Concord, Dhaka -1229, Bangladesh\r\n\r\nWednesday, April 24, 2024\r\n\r\nWEBNS Technology Ltd.\r\nLevel-07, 152/2A-2, \r\nRowshan Tower, Panthapath, Dhaka-1205.\r\n\r\nDear Sir or Madam,\r\n\r\nI’m excited to be applying for the Business Development Manager which has been advertised on BDjobs.com. I believe that my education, skill-set, and experience make me a suitable candidate for this role.\r\n\r\n\r\nWith more than nine years’ experience as a Business Development Professional, I am adept in user requirements gathering, market research, and forecasting. Moreover, while my on-the-job experience has afforded me a well-rounded skill set, including first-rate strategic planning and project management abilities, I excel at:\r\n\r\n-Developing client proposals and presenting at stakeholder meetings.\r\n-Coordinating with other departments to best align company goals and strategies.\r\n-Working with product development teams to implement customer feedback.\r\n-Motivating team members and junior staff to exceptional performance.\r\n\r\nIn addition to my experience and personal qualities, I have a solid educational foundation and a passion for technology and business. I am extremely enthusiastic about ‘WEBNS Technology Ltd.’’ focus on working with leading IT firms and would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your business development goals.\r\n\r\nPlease review my attached resume for additional details regarding my expertise and career achievements. I will follow up to request an appointment to discuss how my experience and background meet your needs.\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nRabiul Islam', 'admin/pdf/career/10218Resume - Rabiul Islam.pdf', 'webns-bus-man-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-23-md-rabiul-islam-60624', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-24 01:06:08', '2024-04-24 01:06:08'),
(54, 13, 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21', 'MD. SAMIUL ALAM', 'samiul.alam0909@gmail.com', '01741016021', '30000', 'To work with a highly acclaimed organization where I could use my educational knowledge and professional experience to strengthen my future career as well as contribute to the people of my country. I am fully confident that I will be able to perform according to desire criteria and hope my contribution will be appreciated to the growth of your reputed organization.\r\nI had worked as Trainee sales officer of One Bank Ltd. for 1.7 years. My responsibility was to maintain relationship with clients and achieve specific targets like new accounts, deposits obtaining.\r\nNow I am working as Executive corporate Sales of Utech infusion Ltd. for 27 months. My\r\nresponsibility is to maintain relationship with clients and achieve specific targets like selling IT products and delivering proper services and supports to clients for set up and establish all types of IT products based on Clients Choice', 'admin/pdf/career/13202CV Samiul Alam 21.pdf', 'webns-bus-exe-2024-apr-21-2024-apr-24-md-samiul-alam-16021', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', 'off', '2024-04-24 10:03:07', '2024-04-24 10:03:07');

